  "body_html": "<p>Drive like a boss and live like a legend with the Jeminise Custom Trucker Comforter Set. Specially designed for truckers, this modern bedding set features the soulful Trucker's Prayer design, showcasing a semi truck, wooden cross, and beautiful decorative scrolls. Perfect as a meaningful gift for family, friends, or yourself, it brings comfort, faith, and inspiration to any bedroom setting.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a customizable text input so you can personalize your trucker bedding with a name or unique message.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping and shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant &amp; Eco-Friendly:</strong> Advanced digital printing ensures colors hold dye and resist fading with no harmful chemicals used.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Comforter Set:</strong> Durable, lightweight, and breathable material that feels like soft cotton and can also be used as a cozy blanket.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, air dry without heat or tumble dry on low heat for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>100% Brushed Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Trucker's Prayer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Trucker Stuff Tapestry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker / Christian Faith</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash Cold, Tumble Dry Low, Do Not Bleach</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
